  "description": "[Original Webtoon](https://page.kakao.com/content/61154360)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[Japanese](https://jp.piccoma.com/web/product/154417)\n\nKangdae, I like it.\" I confessed with courage to my colleague, who has been in unrequited love for three years. I thought a happy campus couple life was finally beginning for me, but suddenly he pops into the army! \"Huh?! This was rejected, wasn't it?\" Grand senior Kang Tae-yang, who is like a feud, approaches Sarang, who is upset by the pain of a broken heart. And an amazing word I heard from him. \"You confessed to me.\" I'm going to be upset because I'm in a broken heart with a rhythm. What the hell are you talking about?! Can Sarang, who has a dream of spending his college life with a thrilling campus couple, achieve that dream?",
